    "title": "'Stranger Things' actor David Harbour visits downtown Abilene - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Shelly Womack No media credit provided. ,\n1 hours ago\nABILENE, Texas ( KTAB/KRBC ) – Downtown Abilene may not be home to Demogorgons, but it did get a visit from a star of Stranger Things this week.\nActor David Harbour, known for his role as Chief Jim Hopper, was spotted in Abilene on Wednesday. According to those who met him, Harbour stopped by several local favorites, including Cypress Street Station, Seven and One Books, and Monk’s Coffee Shop.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KTAB - BigCountryHomepage.com.",
